        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Due to our expertise in raw materials sourcing, chemical formulation, and quality control, developed over more than two decades, we are typically able to move a new custom product into production in a matter of weeks from order receipt.",
